Bulk WhatsApp Messages

Send up to 100 WhatsApp messages to different recipients in a single API call.

Endpoint

POST https://:/v2/accounts//messages

Request Body

Send an array of message objects:

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "from": "+919876500001",
      "to": "+919876543210",
      "content": {
        "recipient_type": "individual",
        "type": "text",
        "text": { "body": "Hi Rahul, your order is ready!" }
      }
    },
    {
      "from": "+919876500001",
      "to": "+919876543211",
      "content": {
        "recipient_type": "individual",
        "type": "text",
        "text": { "body": "Hi Priya, your order is ready!" }
      }
    }
  ]
}

cURL Example

curl -X POST "https://:@api.exotel.com/v2/accounts//messages" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "messages": [
      {
        "from": "+919876500001",
        "to": "+919876543210",
        "content": {
          "recipient_type": "individual",
          "type": "template",
          "template": {
            "name": "order_ready",
            "language": { "code": "en", "policy": "deterministic" },
            "components": [{ "type": "body", "parameters": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Rahul" }] }]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "+919876500001",
        "to": "+919876543211",
        "content": {
          "recipient_type": "individual",
          "type": "template",
